<title>USA: Baxter International may issue debt.</title>
<headline>Baxter International may issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baxter International Inc is expected to tap the market with a two-part debt offering via lead underwriter Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, high-grade syndicate sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The A3/A rated deal is expected to consist of $250 million in 10-year debt and $200 million in 30-year debt, sources said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
